# Byte fidelity over EOL normalisation.  Several released tables and documents
# are pinned by md5 in docs/manuscript_number_audit.md, so git must store and
# restore them byte for byte: no CRLF conversion anywhere.
* -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.parquet binary
*.pth binary
